MODULE: RefusalSourceAttributedDropsSnapshotSource
TARGET: RefusalSourceAttributed
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: snapshot shedding loses its own refusal source
PERTURBS: ShedOpen

--- FIND
        !.source = IF Shed(LogicalValue(1)) THEN "SnapshotCursorOpen" ELSE @]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: snapshot admission must not borrow a writer or saga source.
        !.source = IF Shed(LogicalValue(1)) THEN "WalAdmission" ELSE @]
--- END
